// ============================================================================
//  ID:             Q01  (report appendix: A1)
//  Name:           Traffic volume by source IP
//  Purpose:        Find the address generating unusual traffic against the web server.
//  Hunt step:      1
//  ATT&CK:         T1595 Active Scanning
//  Tables:         HartwellApache_CL
//  Time range:     2026-10-23 04:00 to 16:00 UTC
//  Environment:    Practice lab
//  Hit looks like: One source address with a request count far above all others,
//                  after setting aside the server's own address and known staff hosts.
//  Result:         192.168.1.100 stood out.
//  Benign noise:   The server itself and the staff hosts (192.168.1.50, 192.168.1.80).
//  Tuning notes:   Change the time window. Append "| order by count_ desc" for a ranked list.
//  Author / date:  Cai Spice · hunt run 2026-10-23, documented 2026-11-20
// ============================================================================

HartwellApache_CL
| where OriginalTime between (datetime(2026-10-23T04:00:00Z) .. datetime(2026-10-23T16:00:00Z))
| summarize count() by SourceIP
